e high school student. He also happens to be the sole heir to the head of a Yakuza Family called the Shuei-gumi. 10 years ago, Raku made a promise… a secret promise with a girl he met. They promised one another that they will “get married when they reunite.” Since then, Raku never let go of the pendant the girl gave him."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"極道一家「集英組」のひとり息子だが、ごく普通の高校生・一条楽。 彼は、10年前、仲良くなった女の子と「再会したら結婚する」という約束をし、 その時に貰ったペンダントを肌身離さずに持っていた。 そんなある日、楽のクラスにやって来た転校生の美少女・桐崎千棘。 最初の出会いから相性最悪で、事ある毎にケンカを繰り返す楽と千棘だが、 とある事情から二人は恋人を演じることに。 恋心を抱く、クラスメイトの小野寺小咲の事を気にしつつも、 恋人のフリを続ける楽。 「偽恋物語」の行く末やいかに！？","tagline":"ウソツキは、恋の始まり。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/scplxDxHoW6SL5QOCL6zHUMHNS7.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/scplxDxHoW6SL5QOCL6zHUMHNS7.png","language":"en","width":781,"height":270},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m8pKDXWtFiU16i4JkDYXRTBtnxI.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m8pKDXWtFiU16i4JkDYXRTBtnxI.svg","language":"ja","width":720,"height":208}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vYfnw5eRLrne4ZLDaRdHgvGyys7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vYfnw5eRLrne4ZLDaRdHgvGyys7.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zPCU9gB7DBO8YwYtvaYJRzyXTQt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zPCU9gB7DBO8YwYtvaYJRzyXTQt.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1020},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x15LnCbRgRlZFnq2kQdbW9tlheZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x15LnCbRgRlZFnq2kQdbW9tlheZ.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6QiG2xmTdo0zDeepPIZdkwv2FZ0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6QiG2xmTdo0zDeepPIZdkwv2FZ0.jpg","language":"en","width":1818,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origin